WEBVTT

00:09:59.578 --> 00:10:01.743
of how it comes about that many of the things

00:10:01.743 --> 00:10:05.134
from my society ended up in the British Museum,

00:10:05.134 --> 00:10:06.945
but we don't have time for that.

00:10:06.945 --> 00:10:08.437
So this object is a soul disc.

00:10:08.437 --> 00:10:09.575
What is a soul disc?

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:11.404
It was worn around the necks

00:10:11.404 --> 00:10:13.974
of the soul-washers of the Asante king.

00:10:13.974 --> 00:10:17.529
What was their job? To wash the king's soul.

00:10:17.529 --> 00:10:19.434
It would take a long while

00:10:19.434 --> 00:10:21.661
to explain how a soul could be the kind of thing

00:10:21.661 --> 00:10:22.961
that could be washed,

00:10:22.961 --> 00:10:25.740
but Rattray knew that this was religion

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:29.243
because souls were in play.

00:10:29.243 --> 00:10:30.989
And similarly,